# Stage-2 exclusions for the Go core — applied via --ignore-file-override (generation
# config, not hand-editing; ADR-SDK-023). Patterns are relative to languages/go/core/.
# NOTE: this generator build's matcher is narrower than gitignore — bare names and root
# globs do not match; every rule needs a `**/` prefix (verified by dry-run, 2026-07-15).

# Test scaffolding — product tests are hand-written under languages/go/tests/.
**/test/**

# The module definition lives at languages/go/go.mod (ADR-SDK-016 subdir module); the
# core is a package of that module, never its own (withGoMod=false; this is the belt).
**/go.mod
**/go.sum

# A committed spec copy would sidestep the single-pin rule (ADR-SDK-006; spec/pin.yaml).
**/api/openapi.yaml

# Standalone-repo/CI scaffolding — meaningless inside the monorepo (ADR-SDK-016).
**/.travis.yml
**/git_push.sh
